{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_05",
  "title": "會飲圖",
  "storyCode": "DT-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d510bf6230fafa5f680a62341a643dd3a3f82b0719db9609ddcd63d9f6f9cba0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "五、四、三、二、一……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "好！鐘聲響了，開始吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，左邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "萊歐斯，前面！右邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘿！哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "先西，後面！左邊！前面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "哈！哈呀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "前後前右左左後！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "呀————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "前後左前右左後！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "呀——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "呼、呼……這附近的墨魎都被處理完了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不會！鎮裡人願意收留我們，我們幫忙解決一些麻煩也是應該的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫還要去田裡幫忙種菜，先走一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "先西這傢伙，已經完全和鎮裡人混熟了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "奇爾查克小哥不也是嘛，張伯剛才還請我叫你解決墨魎就過去喝酒呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "那老伯也太不服輸了，喝不過我還硬要挑戰我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "黎小姐，我今天能去你那裡喝茶嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "瑪露希爾妹妹有空，我自然是有空的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "今天輪到瑪露希爾妹妹講你的冒險故事了，我可是非常期待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不過……我還記得，你們剛到這裡時，說過自己還要去拯救萊歐斯小哥的妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "還不出發沒關係嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……嗯，救法琳是我們的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "但是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "要找到離開的方法畢竟不能急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "而且，在這裡的生活也很好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "到時候再說吧，你說對吧，萊歐斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯？什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你又不聽我說話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "……呵呵，萊歐斯小哥對墨魎的熱情如今在鎮裡也已經是無人不知了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "但是這種叫墨魎的史萊姆真的很有趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "牠們有自己固定的形狀，能明顯看出頭身和四肢的區別，攻擊方式不是包裹敵人的頭部，更像是野獸攻擊人的方式，而且還會叫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "最特殊的是，我們每次擊殺魔物都會留下屍體，但牠們什麼都不會留下，除了一攤黑色的水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我昨天把牠們的弱點告訴了鎮民們，但是鎮民們卻好像並不是很激動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "因為對這種東西著迷的只有你一個啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……是這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "可是連奇爾查克都學會上手反擊了，這些鎮民卻一直學不會。每次看他們對付墨魎都好像根本不知道怎麼攻擊一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我甚至覺得牠們還能聽得懂人說話……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這很奇怪，先西也說，牠們不像史萊姆一樣，有明確的器官部位……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "好了好了，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯？還有漏網之魚嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯？這隻有點眼熟……牠臉上有痣，我好像之前看過……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "牠前幾天已經被我打死了啊，怎麼又出現了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……什麼情況，難道牠們會復活？……我去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "記得回來吃飯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……唉，根本沒聽到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "對不起，這傢伙就這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "沒關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "比起這個，瑪露希爾妹妹，你還記得，你們已經來到婆山鎮多久了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我當然……\n咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們來到這裡多久了來著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "等、等等……這也太多了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎們",
      "text": "嘎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我們在這裡待的時間不短了，每天都殺死了那麼多墨魎，沒想到這裡還有這麼多？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這麼多同類聚在一起也沒有產生內部爭鬥……牠們內部是非常和諧的狀態嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎們",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "但沒有看到墨魎寶寶啊……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這麼一說，雌雄似乎也看不出來，這裡的都是成年體，沒有年老的，怎麼看都不像一個魔物生活的群落……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "欸？等等，剛剛那隻眼熟的一下子去哪裡了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……糟了，被發現了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "得想個辦法，不能讓牠引來更多的墨魎！否則我一個人解決不了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "不好了，牠要叫了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "塞你一嘴水果！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎……唔？吧唧吧唧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "什麼意思，還要？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嘎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "只要你別大聲叫，就可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "給你，這都是我準備當零食吃的……你安安靜靜地吃，吃了之後跟過來，跟我一起繞到牆後……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……好乖啊，怎麼回事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "（偷偷爬向牆後）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "（瞄準掉在地上的杏子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "（成功叼到杏子並大快朵頤）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "牠剛剛還在襲擊小鎮，現在為了幾個水果就變得溫順了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "（吃吃吃）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "（一口咬住萊歐斯的口袋）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……啊？這是在幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "看上去是來攻擊鎮民的，但打贏了看不出開心，打輸了也就跑了，居然會躲在這裡偷吃杏子……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯……倒是會因為爭食而打架，但要說是為了食物，山上的果子肯定比鎮裡的多，這麼頻繁地攻擊小鎮，怎麼會只為吃幾個果子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "鎮民沒抓走牠們的幼崽，也不像是侵佔了牠們的領地，牠們究竟哪裡來的敵意……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯？這不就是剛剛長著痣的那隻？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "看招！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊歐斯一抬手，一顆杏子飛出，噗的一聲，砸中了眼熟的墨魎的腦袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "牠被砸得差點跌倒，急得想要立起上半身站起來，用兩隻短手捂住腦袋。\n但隨即，牠也聞到了杏子香甜的氣息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "還真是來吃杏子的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "接著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嗚！嘎嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "吧唧吧唧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "讓我仔細看看……長著痣，頭稍微大一點，尾巴細長但又有分岔……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "你就是之前那隻！當時我就覺得你奇怪，肚子吃得那麼鼓，都走不動了，簡直不像來襲擊鎮子的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嗚……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "真的復活了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "也就是說，你們一直在這裡重複著死了又活的生活嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嘿，這倒是很像我們在迷宮的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "text": "嘎嗚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "真是奇怪，有這樣的習性，你們去進攻鎮子又是為了什麼呢……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "是想吃杏子嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
